  "repair": [
    "A bounded AX reader supplies role/label descriptions, enabled state (including unknown) and normalized full-display bounds for native controls in the current foreground window. It reads no editable values or selections, posts no input, and grants no target authority.",
    "The reader limits discovery to 96 nodes, 16 controls and a 0.75-second read deadline with 0.1-second AX messaging timeouts. Secure/protected/hidden branches and controls outside the observed window or display are omitted. Application/window identity and geometry are checked again before publication; cancellation and withdrawn ownership stop the read.",
    "Current control geometry is sent once with the latest screenshot to Fara, Holo and GUI-Owl. It is not attached to old screenshots or retained as stale geometry in history. Browser requests reject mixed native controls, and all adapters count the serialized catalogue toward their existing text budgets.",
    "Raw rectangle sizes are validated before CGRect can standardize negative stored dimensions. Both traversal and label clipping set the explicit truncation flag. Long labels are clipped at whole-character boundaries.",
    "Native action admission, coordinates and effects are unchanged. Discovery runs once per model observation, not during every action revalidation. The native scripted workflow now stops at its first rejected action and retains before/after fixture images for any future rejection."
  ],
